'''Rakes''' are used in the [[Farming]] skill to remove [[weeds]] from [[Farming#Patches|farming patches]]. It can be bought from [[Farming shop]]s. In addition, it can also be purchased from most of the [[Group of Advanced Gardeners|gardeners]] who look after your farming patches. A [[tool leprechaun]] can store one for you.

